The inline attribute interior is space-only, the attribute line is not

```
*x*{.a .b}

*y*{ .c}

*z*{.d }

[w]{ }
.
<p><strong class="a b">x</strong></p>
<p><strong class="c">y</strong></p>
<p><strong class="d">z</strong></p>
<p><span>w</span></p>
```

